msgid "Armature"
msgstr "骨架"

#: vrse_fbx_exporter-v1.3.2/VRseFbx_BatchExporter.py:2545
msgid "Armatures auto-included"
msgstr "自动包含骨架"

#: vrse_fbx_exporter-v1.3.2/VRseFbx_BatchExporter.py:1063
msgid "Ask for confirmation before exporting meshes that carry more than two\nUV maps. The dialog lists the objects so they can be fixed (Cancel),\nleft out of the FBX (Skip), or exported as-is"
msgstr "在导出带有两个以上\nUV 贴图的网格前请求确认。对话框会列出这些物体，以便修复（取消）、\n从 FBX 中排除（跳过）或按原样导出"

#: vrse_fbx_exporter-v1.3.2/VRseFbx_BatchExporter.py:1040
msgid "Automatically create empty Materials folders for Unity workflow"
msgstr "为 Unity 工作流自动创建空的 Materials 文件夹"

#: vrse_fbx_exporter-v1.3.2/VRseFbx_BatchExporter.py:843
msgid "Bake object LOCATION into the mesh before export, so Unity reads\nposition 0,0,0.\n\nThis moves every asset to the world origin, which is usually only\nwanted for single-prop exports. Off by default"
msgstr "导出前将物体位置烘焙到网格中，使 Unity 读取到\n位置 0,0,0。\n\n这会将每个资产移动到世界原点，通常只适用于\n单个道具导出。默认关闭"

#: vrse_fbx_exporter-v1.3.2/VRseFbx_BatchExporter.py:854
msgid "Bake object ROTATION into the mesh before export, so Unity reads\nrotation 0,0,0. Equivalent to Blender's Ctrl+A > Rotation.\n\nApplied to temporary copies - your scene objects are not modified"
msgstr "导出前将物体旋转烘焙到网格中，使 Unity 读取到\n旋转 0,0,0。等同于 Blender 的 Ctrl+A > 旋转。\n\n应用于临时副本 - 不会修改场景中的物体"

#: vrse_fbx_exporter-v1.3.2/VRseFbx_BatchExporter.py:864
msgid "Bake object SCALE into the mesh before export, so Unity reads\nscale 1,1,1. Equivalent to Blender's Ctrl+A > Scale.\n\nApplied to temporary copies - your scene objects are not modified"
msgstr "导出前将物体缩放烘焙到网格中，使 Unity 读取到\n缩放 1,1,1。等同于 Blender 的 Ctrl+A > 缩放。\n\n应用于临时副本 - 不会修改场景中的物体"

#: vrse_fbx_exporter-v1.3.2/VRseFbx_BatchExporter.py:1048
msgid "Before export, validate the second UV layer on the evaluated mesh that will be written to FBX"
msgstr "导出前，在将写入 FBX 的求值网格上验证第二 UV 层"

#: vrse_fbx_exporter-v1.3.2/VRseFbx_BatchExporter.py:980
msgid "Blender cameras, written as FBX camera nodes.\nUnity imports them as GameObjects but does NOT create a Unity Camera\ncomponent. Usually left off for game assets"
msgstr "Blender 摄像机，写入为 FBX 摄像机节点。\nUnity 会将其导入为 GameObject，但不会创建 Unity Camera\n组件。游戏资产通常保持关闭"

#: vrse_fbx_exporter-v1.3.2/VRseFbx_BatchExporter.py:989
msgid "Blender lights, written as FBX light nodes.\nUnity ignores FBX lights for baking; scene lighting is set up in Unity.\nUsually left off for game assets"
msgstr "Blender 灯光，写入为 FBX 灯光节点。\nUnity 在烘焙时会忽略 FBX 灯光；场景光照在 Unity 中设置。\n游戏资产通常保持关闭"

#: vrse_fbx_exporter-v1.3.2/VRseFbx_BatchExporter.py:2472
msgid "Breaks armatures"
msgstr "会破坏骨架"

#: vrse_fbx_exporter-v1.3.2/VRseFbx_BatchExporter.py:980
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "摄像机"

#: vrse_fbx_exporter-v1.3.2/VRseFbx_BatchExporter.py:1056
msgid "Cancel an FBX file when an exported mesh is missing UV2 or contains invalid UV coordinates"
msgstr "当导出的网格缺少 UV2 或包含无效 UV 坐标时，取消导出该 FBX 文件"

#: vrse_fbx_exporter-v1.3.2/VRseFbx_BatchExporter.py:1442
msgid "Cancel to fix the UV maps first."
msgstr "取消以先修复 UV 贴图。"

